paragraph start
A note is only useful when it can be found and understood later. A named block tells a reader and a script what each piece of text is.
answer start
for: qe995c0
asked: Does this paragraph hold one idea a reader could restate?
Yes. Named blocks make a note findable and readable.
answer end
